# Classic host / assets (gated)

Full Width WP, SPA host, canvas clip, SiteAssets, CSP, chrome On/Off, သို့ bulk baseline wave scope ထဲရှိရင်:

1. Bulk all pages / wired baseline → `.cursor/skills/bulk-classic-to-spfx-baseline/SKILL.md` + `docs/migration/`
2. မဟုတ်ရင် `.cursor/skills/classic-to-spfx-migration/SKILL.md` ဖတ်
3. References load (UI migrate — typography = **required**, optional မဟုတ်):
   - Segoe inherit / font-weight / menu link underline self-check → `references/visual-typography.md` **(`classic-visual-parity` တွဲ)**
   - Full-width / SPA / 450px clip → `references/host-modes.md`
   - Site Pages chrome hide → `references/site-chrome.md`
   - Images/vendor/CSP/remount → `references/siteassets-gotchas.md`

## This repo
- Classic page တစ်ခု = web part တစ်ခု (hub `pageKey` router မသုံး)
- Classic chrome = **inline per ASPX** — user မတောင်းရင် `ui-loader` / PortalShell AC မသုံး
- Data = `SPHttpClient`; `@pnp/sp` ask-first
- Visual SoT = `classic-visual-parity` + `uikit-to-spfx-visual-parity`

## Reject
- Yeoman/Heft ကို classic ASPX root ထဲ ထည့်
- `blob:` classic script boot
- Hardcoded `/sites/…` URLs
- Visual PASS မတိုင်မီ Fluent restyle
